# Architecture Migration: SSG-First, Zero-Runtime-Data Emoji Platform

Restructure the CopyPaste Unicode project so that **all browsable content is pre-rendered static HTML at build time**, the full dataset **never enters client bundles**, and search uses a **lazy-loaded minimal index on the client**.

---

