## Target Architecture

```
                 ┌─────────────────┐
                 │ Unicode Dataset  │
                 └────────┬────────┘
                          │
                     BUILD TIME
                          │
                 ┌────────▼────────┐
                 │ Data Transform   │
                 └────────┬────────┘
                          │
            ┌─────────────┴─────────────┐
            │                           │
            ▼                           ▼
      Static HTML                  Search Index
      (all pages)              (minimal JSON, lazy)
            │                           │
            ▼                           ▼
           CDN                       Browser
            │                    (on search focus)
            ▼
         Browser
            │
      ┌─────┼──────┐
      ▼     ▼      ▼
    Browse Search  Copy
    local   local  local
```

