## Proposed Changes

### Component 1: Build Pipeline — Search Index Generation

Update the build script to output a **minimal search index** separate from the full data.

#### [MODIFY] [build-data.ts](file:///c:/Users/dl/Desktop/Main_Projects_V2/emogi/scripts/build-data.ts)

- Add generation of `search-index.json` — a minimal array containing only `{ id, character, name, slug, category, keywords }` for search (same fields as current `all-characters.json`, but this file is **only for search**, not browsing)
- Remove `all-characters.json` generation (browsing will be static HTML, not client-loaded JSON)
- Add generation of `emoji-by-category.json` — a build-time artifact mapping `category → CharacterItem[]` used by SSG pages (not shipped to browser)
- The build-time artifacts go to `apps/web/.data/` (a gitignored build cache, not `/public/`)
- Only `search-index.json` goes to `apps/web/public/data/`

